@startuml
[*] --> Power-on : Power-on event
Power-on --> Ready to use : Everything fine during startup
Power-on --> Normal : Problem during startup
Ready to use --> Monitoring : User activation request
Monitoring --> Alarm triggered : Sensor trigger during monitoring
Alarm triggered --> Monitoring : False alarm or time ends
Ready to use --> Normal : User password entry
Normal --> [*] : Power-off event
@enduml
